      "kind": "word",
      "promptEs": "deja",
      "answerEn": "lets; allows",
      "noteEn": "Deja is a present form of dejar used with one person or thing that permits an action. A short word such as me, te, nos, or les can identify who is allowed to act.",
      "example": { "es": "El permiso nos deja entrar.", "en": "The permit lets us enter." },
      "tags": ["word", "verb", "permission", "A2"]
