      "kind": "phrase",
      "promptEs": "el otro lado de + lugar",
      "questionEn": "How do you identify the opposite side of a place, street, or object?",
      "answerEn": "Use el otro lado de, then name the place or object.",
      "noteEn": "Al otro lado de often describes where something is; del otro lado de can identify something coming from that opposite side. Al combines a + el, and del combines de + el.",
